\description{
The `Chart` class provides a flexible interface to build Office OpenXML
(OOXML) chart objects. It allows for granular control over gridlines,
secondary axes, and combined chart types (e.g., Bar and Line) within a
single plot area.

An R6 class to create and manipulate Office OpenXML (OOXML) Extended Charts (ChartEx),
including Waterfall, Sunburst, Treemap, and Region Maps, which are not
supported by standard Office Open XML chart types.
}
